EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT

This Employment Agreement ("Agreement") is entered into as of
{{ effective_date | default("____________") }}, between:

Employer: {{ employer_name | default("[Employer Name]") }}
Address:  {{ employer_address | default("[Employer Address]") }}

AND

Employee: {{ employee_name | default("[Employee Name]") }}
Address:  {{ employee_address | default("[Employee Address]") }}

1. POSITION AND DUTIES
   The Employer hereby employs the Employee as
   {{ designation | default("[Designation]") }} in the
   {{ department | default("[Department]") }} department.
   The Employee shall report to {{ reporting_to | default("[Manager Name/Title]") }}.

2. COMMENCEMENT AND TERM
   Employment shall commence on {{ start_date | default("[Start Date]") }}
   {% if employment_type == "fixed" %}
   and shall be for a fixed term ending {{ end_date | default("[End Date]") }}.
   {% else %}
   and shall continue until terminated in accordance with this Agreement.
   {% endif %}

3. COMPENSATION
   a) Basic Salary: INR {{ basic_salary | default("[Amount]") }} per month
   b) Other Allowances: {{ allowances | default("[HRA, Travel, etc.]") }}
   c) Total CTC: INR {{ ctc | default("[Total CTC]") }} per annum
   Salary shall be paid on or before the {{ pay_day | default("last") }}
   working day of each month.

4. WORKING HOURS
   The standard working hours shall be
   {{ working_hours | default("9 hours per day, 5 days a week") }}.

5. LEAVE
   The Employee shall be entitled to:
   - {{ annual_leave | default("18") }} days of paid annual leave per year
   - {{ sick_leave | default("12") }} days of sick leave per year
   - Public holidays as declared by the Employer

6. CONFIDENTIALITY AND NON-COMPETE
   The Employee agrees to maintain strict confidentiality of all
   proprietary information and shall not engage in any competing business
   during employment and for {{ non_compete_period | default("1 year") }}
   after cessation of employment.

7. TERMINATION
   Either Party may terminate this Agreement by providing
   {{ notice_period | default("30 days'") }} written notice.
   The Employer may terminate immediately for cause.

8. GOVERNING LAW
   This Agreement is governed by Indian labour laws, including the
   applicable Labour Codes, and subject to jurisdiction in
   {{ jurisdiction | default("Mumbai") }}.

IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the Parties have executed this Agreement.

